# Normalise on commit, checkout as LF everywhere. Windows checkouts with
# core.autocrlf=true otherwise store CRLF in blobs, which makes every diff noisy
# and defeats the cross-OS determinism argument in docs/phase0/REPORT.md §4.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.exe binary
